# Example OPC UA messages for the opcua-dpi decoder.

# HEL (Hello) — header only in this example.
48454C4608000000

# OPN (OpenSecureChannel) with SecurityPolicy None.
# MSG: secure channel 1, policy "None", null certificate/thumbprint, sequence 1.
4F504E462400000001000000040000004E6F6E65FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF0100000001000000

# MSG carrying a WriteRequest (service NodeId 673, four-byte encoding).
4D53474620000000010000000100000002000000020000000100A10201000000

# MSG carrying a CallRequest (service NodeId 712, four-byte encoding): a method
# call on the server.
4D53474620000000010000000100000002000000030000000100C80201000000

# MSG carrying a BrowseRequest (service NodeId 527, four-byte encoding):
# address-space discovery.
4D534746200000000100000001000000020000000400000001000F0201000000
